#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:27
msgid ""
"Mattermost notifies you of new activity you're directly involved in. How "
"you're notified depends on what Mattermost client you're using, the type "
"of Mattermost activity you're being notified about, and how you prefer to"
" be notified."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 사용자가 직접 관여한 새 활동에 대해 알림을 보냅니다. 알림받는 "
"방식은 사용 중인 OKR.BEST 클라이언트, 알림받는 OKR.BEST 활동 유형, 알림받기를 "
"원하는 방식에 따라 달라집니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:31
msgid "**Missing notifications?**"
msgstr "**알림이 오지 않나요?**"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:33
msgid ""
"Your mobile device may have Mattermost notifications disabled. See the "
":ref:`manage your mobile notifications <end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-mobile-notifications:enable notifications>` for details."
msgstr ""
"모바일 기기에서 OKR.BEST 알림이 비활성화되어 있을 수 있습니다. 자세한 내용은 "
":ref:`모바일 알림 관리 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mobile-"
"notifications:enable notifications>`\\ 를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:34
msgid ""
"You may need to grant permissions in the Mattermost :ref:`desktop app "
"<end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-desktop-notifications:enable "
"notifications>` or :ref:`web browser <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-web-notifications:enable notifications>` to show notifications."
msgstr ""
"알림을 표시하려면 OKR.BEST :ref:`데스크톱 앱 <end-user-guide/preferences"
"/manage-your-desktop-notifications:enable notifications>`\\ 이나 :ref:`웹 "
"브라우저 <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-web-notifications:enable "
"notifications>`\\ 에서 권한을 부여해야 할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:35
msgid ""
"Visit our :doc:`troubleshoot notifications </end-user-guide/preferences"
"/troubleshoot-notifications>` documentation for guidance on ensuring you "
"receive Mattermost notifications."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 알림을 확실히 받기 위한 안내는 :doc:`알림 문제 해결 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/troubleshoot-notifications>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:38
msgid "You're in control"
msgstr "사용자가 직접 제어합니다"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:40
msgid ""
"You are in control of how, when, and where you're notified of activity "
"that matters to you based on how you prefer to work and collaborate. To "
"access notification preferences:"
msgstr ""
"선호하는 업무·협업 방식에 따라 자신에게 중요한 활동을 어떻게, 언제, 어디서 "
"알림받을지 직접 제어할 수 있습니다. 알림 환경설정에 접근하려면:"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:42
msgid ""
"In a web browser or the desktop app, select the **Settings** |gear| icon "
"located in the top right corner of the screen to manage your notification"
" preferences."
msgstr ""
"웹 브라우저나 데스크톱 앱에서는 화면 오른쪽 위 모서리의 **Settings** |gear| "
"아이콘을 선택해 알림 환경설정을 관리합니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:47
msgid "Use the Settings icon to customize your Mattermost user experience."
msgstr "설정 아이콘을 사용해 OKR.BEST 사용자 경험을 사용자 지정합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:43
msgid ""
"On mobile, tap your profile picture, then tap **Settings > "
"Notifications**."
msgstr ""
"모바일에서는 프로필 사진을 탭한 다음 **Settings > Notifications**\\ 를 "
"탭합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:45
msgid ""
"See the `Default notifications <#default-notifications>`__ table below "
"for details on customizing your notification experience based on your "
"preferred Mattermost client."
msgstr ""
"선호하는 OKR.BEST 클라이언트에 따라 알림 경험을 사용자 지정하는 방법에 대한 "
"자세한 내용은 아래 `기본 알림 <#default-notifications>`__ 표를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:49
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v9.8, your desktop and mobile notification preferences "
"have been combined together under **Notifications**. If you're using an "
"older Mattermost release and older Mattermost clients, you'll find "
"separate preferences for desktop and mobile."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST v9.8부터 데스크톱과 모바일 알림 환경설정이 **Notifications** 아래로 "
"통합되었습니다. 이전 OKR.BEST 릴리스와 이전 OKR.BEST 클라이언트를 사용한다면 "
"데스크톱과 모바일에 대한 별도의 환경설정이 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:52
msgid "Default notifications"
msgstr "기본 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:54
msgid ""
"Mattermost notifies you of new activity, including unread activity, "
":ref:`direct <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct message "
"channels>` and :ref:`group <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:group message channels>` messages, and :doc:`@mentions </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>`, "
":doc:`keywords </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-"
"keywords-notifications>` you're actively watching, :doc:`thread replies "
"</end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-notifications>`, "
"and unread activity in :doc:`specific channels </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-channel-specific-notifications>`."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST는 읽지 않은 활동, :ref:`개인 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:direct message channels>` 메시지와 :ref:`그룹 <end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/channel-types:group message channels>` 메시지, :doc:`@멘션 "
"</end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-"
"notifications>`, 적극적으로 지켜보는 :doc:`키워드 </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/manage-your-mentions-keywords-notifications>`, :doc:`스레드 "
"답글 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-thread-reply-"
"notifications>`, :doc:`특정 채널 </end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"channel-specific-notifications>`\\ 의 읽지 않은 활동을 포함한 새 활동에 대해 "
"알림을 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:56
msgid ""
"The table below lists the types of notifications you can expect to see "
"and hear in Mattermost. Select your preferred Mattermost clients to learn"
" more about notifications for that client."
msgstr ""
"아래 표는 OKR.BEST에서 보고 들을 수 있는 알림 유형을 나열합니다. 해당 "
"클라이언트의 알림에 대해 자세히 알아보려면 선호하는 OKR.BEST 클라이언트를 "
"선택하세요."

