#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:81
msgid "Email notifications"
msgstr "이메일 알림"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:83
msgid ""
"When your admin :ref:`enables email notifications <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:enable email notifications>`,"
" Mattermost notifications are sent to you via email for :doc:`@mentions "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-people>` and :ref:`direct messages "
"<end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-types:direct message channels>` as "
"soon as you're away from Mattermost for 5 minutes."
msgstr ""
"관리자가 :ref:`이메일 알림을 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/site-"
"configuration-settings:enable email notifications>`\\ 한 경우, OKR.BEST에서 "
"5분 동안 자리를 비우면 :doc:`@멘션 </end-user-guide/collaborate/mention-"
"people>`\\ 과 :ref:`개인 메시지 <end-user-guide/collaborate/channel-"
"types:direct message channels>`\\ 에 대한 OKR.BEST 알림이 이메일로 "
"전송됩니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:85
msgid ""
"You can also opt in to be notified by email about thread replies you're "
"following."
msgstr "팔로우 중인 스레드 답글에 대해 이메일로 알림받도록 선택할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:87
msgid ""
"Additionally, if your admin :ref:`enables email batching <administration-"
"guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:enable email batching>`, "
"email-based notifications are batched, and you can customize how "
"frequenly you receive batched notifications by going to **Settings > "
"Notifications > Email notifications**. The default frequency is 15 "
"minutes. Choosing every 15 minutes or every hour will reduce the number "
"of emails you receive."
msgstr ""
"또한 관리자가 :ref:`이메일 배치를 활성화 <administration-guide/configure/site-"
"configuration-settings:enable email batching>`\\ 한 경우, 이메일 기반 알림이 "
"배치 처리되며 **Settings > Notifications > Email notifications**\\ 로 이동해 "
"배치 알림을 받는 빈도를 사용자 지정할 수 있습니다. 기본 빈도는 15분입니다. "
"15분마다 또는 1시간마다를 선택하면 받는 이메일 수가 줄어듭니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:89
msgid ""
"Disable email notifications by going to **Settings > Notifications > "
"Email notifications** and changing **On** to **Off**."
msgstr ""
"**Settings > Notifications > Email notifications**\\ 로 이동해 **On**\\ 을 "
"**Off**\\ 로 변경하여 이메일 알림을 비활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:92
msgid "Missing notifications?"
msgstr "알림이 오지 않나요?"

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-notifications.rst:94
msgid ""
"Visit the Mattermost `notifications Knowledge Base article "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/articles/19161390661780"
"-Troubleshooting-Mattermost-Notifications>`_ for additional "
"troubleshooting tips and tricks."
msgstr ""
"추가 문제 해결 팁과 요령은 Mattermost `알림 지식 베이스 문서 "
"<https://support.mattermost.com/hc/en-us/articles/19161390661780"
"-Troubleshooting-Mattermost-Notifications>`_\\ 를 참고하세요."

